<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 29.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 29.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Libyan leader Muammar Gaddafi arrived in Tunis for a visit at the invitation of President Ben Ali. Talks started for new steps in bilateral cooperation. President Ben Ali stresses the need of developping joint projects.</p>
<p>- Tunisia to import 10,000 tonnes of potatoes.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>	  - President and Gaddafi stress the need of building the</p>
<p>Arab Maghreb Union.</p>
